FILE: owns.rs
MOD: commands/owns
OWNS: concept-to-module lookup — searches owns fields, module IDs, and file names
PROFILE: [io, pure-core]
CHANGE-FREQUENCY: stable

run: &str * bool → Result<(), String> [io, boundary]
  calls: ArchContext::load
  note: case-insensitive substring match on owns[], module.id, module.file; deduplicates matches by module path

DEPENDS-ON: context

KEY-INVARIANTS:
- deduplication is by module path string — a module matched by owns AND by module.id only appears once in output

